<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>
  <!--
    Flat decks on Frontline Workshop's vehicles (D'thorga Vehicles 0.98.0, D'thorga Framework 0.217.0; docs/development/vehicle-accessories.md, "Built: tents
    for every vehicle"; the owner's picks of 22 Nov 2026, from a list the agent drew up by looking at each vehicle's own picture). Each
    vehicle named here has an open load bed, so it may be fitted with a deck tent: a tent that stands on the bed, with a small room inside
    to walk into. Only the vehicle's Def is marked; nothing of its author's code, art or figures is changed. The rows give the tent's
    inside, sized to the bed (authored): B over b a bed, E the flap, a dot the floor. Not yet tested in game.
  -->
  <!-- The Land Cruiser J70: a small pickup. Its bed is short, so one bed. Its own upgrades may mount a mortar or a howitzer on the same bed; nothing here stops both being fitted, which is the player's to judge. -->
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationAddModExtension">
    <xpath>Defs/Vehicles.VehicleDef[defName="FW_JSeventy"]</xpath>
    <value>
      <li Class="Phobos.VehicleSystems.PhobosFlatDeckExtension">
        <rows>
          <li>B.</li>
          <li>bE</li>
        </rows>
      </li>
    </value>
  </Operation>
</Patch>
